   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT82:20ac3",
   "off": 133827,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  『始まりの母』が残した\r  人工知能…",
   "en": "an artificial intelligence left by the 'First Mother'...",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT82:20aee",
   "off": 133870,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT82:20af1",
   "off": 133873,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  そして アクセスできる\r  のは正しい遺伝子コードを  受け継いだ『王国の娘』…",
   "en": "And the only one who can access it is a 'Daughter of the Kingdom' who has inherited the correct genetic code...",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT82:20b43",
   "off": 133955,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT82:20b46",
   "off": 133958,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  それは高度な医療技術情報  を口移しに伝える\r  巫女なのです…」",
   "en": "She is a priestess who passes on advanced medical knowledge by word of mouth...\"",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT82:20b8b",
