   "off": 134032,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "リスプ／キラル\r「キラルは人工の体をもつが\r  ゆえに…",
   "en": "Risp and Kiral\r\"Because Kiral has an artificial body...",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT82:20bca",
   "off": 134090,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT82:20bcd",
   "off": 134093,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  神経系を人工知能と直接\r  接続できました",
   "en": "she could connect her nervous system directly to the artificial intelligence.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT82:20bfc",
   "off": 134140,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT82:20bff",
   "off": 134143,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  しかし そのため人工知能\r  に寄生した者に\r  心を支配されてしまった…",
   "en": "But because of that, her mind fell under the control of the thing that had made the AI its host...",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT82:20c4a",
